    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4457" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλό-θροος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, 
			contr.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλό-θρους</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ουν</span> (as always in Trag.) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>speaking a strange tongue</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπ᾽ ἀλλοθρόους ἀνθρώπους, κατ᾽ ἀλλοθρόους
				ἀνθρ.</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				1.183
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				3.302
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				15.453
			</span></i>: generally, <i>foreign</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρατός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.78
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Αἴγυπτος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					3.11
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					1200
				</span></i>
			 ; <i>strange, alien</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γνώμη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					844
				</span></i>
			.—Not in 
				Att.
			Prose.</div>
